### Crear categoria


PUT http://localhost:8080/api/productos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Mouse","descripcion":"Inalambrico","precio":45000,"stock":25,"categoriaId":1}
### Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:8081/api/categorias